  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style="text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">My name is Liz Weisenfluh. I’m a board-certified lactation consultant, certified birth and postpartum doula, and <a target="_blank" href="https://www.jenholland.com/babylisteningmethod.html">Baby Listening Method</a> practitioner. After working with families postpartum for many years, I started Traditional Birth Services in 2025 to offer specialized support throughout the whole perinatal period. I love meeting families in pregnancy and getting the chance to offer continued evidence-based and holistic care well into their parenting journey. Whether you’re looking for prenatal education, hands-on doula support, or lactation guidance to solve present challenges, I’d love to hear from you!</p></div>


  
